		(descr "RECOM RPA20-xxxxSAW (no suffix: no CTRL pin, Trim fitted) isolated DC/DC, 25.4 x 25.4 x 10.2 mm DIP, without heat sink; pad numbers are the RPA20's. Positions from RECOM's recommended footprint (top view), datasheets/discrete-and-power/RECOM-RPA20-AW.pdf PD-8: pins d1.0 +/-0.1, holes 6 x d1.5. THE RP20-xxxxSAW (its active successor) DROPS INTO THE SAME HOLES with the same function in each (datasheets/discrete-and-power/RECOM-RP20-AW.pdf PD-6), numbered differently: its -Vout is 6 and +Vout 4 (the RPA20's 4 and 6), and it has no Trim pin - swap pads 4 and 6 here and in the symbol to buy it")
